---
// Banner de pilares y garantías artesanales de Nubeterapia
---

<section class="benefits-section" id="sobre-nosotros" aria-label="Garantías de calidad artesanal">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="benefits-grid">
      <!-- Pilar 1 -->
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-icon-wrapper">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4 class="benefit-title">Hechos a Mano</h4>
          <p class="benefit-desc">Elaborados con amor y dedicación en lotes reducidos en Tenerife.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pilar 2 -->
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-icon-wrapper">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"></path>
            <path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4 class="benefit-title">100% Naturales</h4>
          <p class="benefit-desc">Glicerina vegetal pura, aceites esenciales y plantas vivas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pilar 3 -->
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-icon-wrapper">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5C6 11.1 5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4 class="benefit-title">Suaves y Nutritivos</h4>
          <p class="benefit-desc">Calidad que tu piel agradece cada día en tu ducha diaria.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pilar 4 -->
      <div class="benefit-item">
        <div class="benefit-icon-wrapper">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-text">
          <h4 class="benefit-title">Sin Parabenos</h4>
          <p class="benefit-desc">Libre de sulfatos, químicos nocivos y derivados del petróleo.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .benefits-section {
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .benefits-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .benefits-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .benefits-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .benefit-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }

  .benefit-icon-wrapper {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background-color: var(--color-sage-tint);
    color: var(--color-sage);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .benefit-item:hover .benefit-icon-wrapper {
    transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.05);
    background-color: var(--color-sage);
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .benefit-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .benefit-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .benefit-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
